   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "REDIS = a whiteboard at the front desk",
   "originalText": "REDIS = a whiteboard at the front desk",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "text_00023",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 66.0,
   "y": 784.0,
   "width": 726.14,
   "height": 325.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_01",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1575003215,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1402211738,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "SET key value NX EX ttl\n\nInstant to read and write (sub-millisecond), one atomic command claims a\nkey and sets its expiry.\n\nIt gets wiped:\n- at the end of the day  =  TTL expiry\n- when the cleaner comes  =  restart\n- when full, old ticks are erased  =  eviction\n- when someone spills coffee  =  failover loss\n- also: someone runs FLUSHALL\n\nGives you a WINDOW, not a guarantee.",
   "originalText": "SET key value NX EX ttl\n\nInstant to read and write (sub-millisecond), one atomic command claims a key and sets its expiry.\n\nIt gets wiped:\n- at the end of the day  =  TTL expiry\n- when the cleaner comes  =  restart\n- when full, old ticks are erased  =  eviction\n- when someone spills coffee  =  failover loss\n- also: someone runs FLUSHALL\n\nGives you a WINDOW, not a guarantee.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "rect_00024",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 860.0,
   "y": 734.0,
   "width": 770.0,
   "height": 387.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
   "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_01",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1403134280,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 383189421,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "text_00025",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 876.0,
   "y": 746.0,
   "width": 629.72,
   "height": 30.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_01",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1457617918,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 720377036,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "POSTGRES UNIQUE = a bound ledger in the archive",
   "originalText": "POSTGRES UNIQUE = a bound ledger in the archive",
   "fontSize": 24,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "text_00026",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 876.0,
   "y": 784.0,
   "width": 707.0,
   "height": 325.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_01",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 264867608,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1962863851,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PRIMARY KEY / UNIQUE constraint\n\nWriting a line takes longer (milliseconds, WAL, index maintenance), and a\nsecond line with the same name is REFUSED BY THE BOOK ITSELF.\n\nNothing is erased unless a clerk tears out a page:\n- you delete the row\n- you drop the constraint\n\nOn disk, durable, transactional, no expiry, no eviction. Grows forever\nunless pruned.\n\nGives you a GUARANTEE for as long as the row lives.",
   "originalText": "PRIMARY KEY / UNIQUE constraint\n\nWriting a line takes longer (milliseconds, WAL, index maintenance), and a second line with the same name is REFUSED BY THE BOOK ITSELF.\n\nNothing is erased unless a clerk tears out a page:\n- you delete the row\n- you drop the constraint\n\nOn disk, durable, transactional, no expiry, no eviction. Grows forever unless pruned.\n\nGives you a GUARANTEE for as long as the row lives.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "text_00027",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 50,
   "y": 1151.0,
   "width": 431.75,
   "height": 32.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_01",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1260585686,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 823815546,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two properties decide everything",
   "originalText": "Two properties decide everything",
   "fontSize": 26,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "rect_00028",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 50.0,
   "y": 1195.5,
   "width": 510.67,
   "height": 179.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#5f3dc4",
   "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_01",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1687527032,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1411866589,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
