   "text": "LOUD: new writes fail, errors and alerts fire. Nothing is\nforgotten, but the claim itself errors (decide fail-open / closed).",
   "originalText": "LOUD: new writes fail, errors and alerts fire. Nothing is forgotten, but the claim itself errors (decide fail-open / closed).",
