   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Note: volatile-ttl and the other volatile-* policies still EVICT dedup keys (they all carry TTLs). Only noeviction refuses to forget; if you use a\nvolatile policy, alert on evicted_keys.",
   "originalText": "Note: volatile-ttl and the other volatile-* policies still EVICT dedup keys (they all carry TTLs). Only noeviction refuses to forget; if you use a volatile policy, alert on evicted_keys.",
