   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Fix: put a unique OWNER TOKEN (a random id per attempt) inside the value. Re-sending that attempt's SET carries the same token, so the\nclaimant can recognise its own claim.\nA timeout never tells you whether the write happened.",
   "originalText": "Fix: put a unique OWNER TOKEN (a random id per attempt) inside the value. Re-sending that attempt's SET carries the same token, so the claimant can recognise its own claim.\nA timeout never tells you whether the write happened.",
