   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "AOF everysec is the usual compromise. RDB\nalone loses too much. \"always\" hurts latency.\nRedis is not the guarantee, so do not over-pay\nfor durability.",
   "originalText": "AOF everysec is the usual compromise. RDB alone loses too much. \"always\" hurts latency.\nRedis is not the guarantee, so do not over-pay for durability.",
