   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Risk: duplicates reach downstream, where the sink constraint absorbs\nthem. A slow Redis never stalls the API.\nUsually RIGHT for events.",
   "originalText": "Risk: duplicates reach downstream, where the sink constraint absorbs them. A slow Redis never stalls the API.\nUsually RIGHT for events.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
