   "text": "INSERT INTO events (...) VALUES (...)\nON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING\nRETURNING event_id;\n\n-- a row comes back only if it was really inserted",
   "originalText": "INSERT INTO events (...) VALUES (...)\nON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING\nRETURNING event_id;\n\n-- a row comes back only if it was really inserted",
