   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Delete in batches by age (LIMIT via ctid or id range) to avoid long locks and bloat, or use TIME PARTITIONS and drop whole\nones (instant, no vacuum)",
   "originalText": "Delete in batches by age (LIMIT via ctid or id range) to avoid long locks and bloat, or use TIME PARTITIONS and drop whole ones (instant, no vacuum)",
