   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "In one sentence: Redis has a window of seconds to hours, by design. Postgres has a window of ZERO while the row exists, plus only the\nwindows YOU create (pruning, restore, constraint mistakes).",
