   "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
   "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_13",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 457667173,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 901478702,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "text_01253",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 66.0,
   "y": 19869.75,
   "width": 409.49,
   "height": 28.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_13",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 596573898,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1643034225,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why not only Postgres at the API?",
   "originalText": "Why not only Postgres at the API?",
   "fontSize": 23,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "text_01254",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 66.0,
   "y": 19906.5,
   "width": 740.42,
   "height": 175.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_13",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 618134531,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 476350918,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "You could insert into an idempotency table, then produce. Durable, but:\n- every request pays a DB round trip and a WAL write on the hot path\n- retry storms hit the primary database\n- there is STILL a gap between the DB claim and the Kafka produce (two\nsystems)\nRedis absorbs repeat traffic more cheaply; the sink constraint is required\nanyway.",
   "originalText": "You could insert into an idempotency table, then produce. Durable, but:\n- every request pays a DB round trip and a WAL write on the hot path\n- retry storms hit the primary database\n- there is STILL a gap between the DB claim and the Kafka produce (two systems)\nRedis absorbs repeat traffic more cheaply; the sink constraint is required anyway.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "rect_01255",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 852.0,
   "y": 19857.75,
   "width": 778.0,
   "height": 235.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_13",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 787004204,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1149872459,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "text_01256",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 868.0,
   "y": 19869.75,
   "width": 229.3,
   "height": 28.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_13",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1456070065,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1749022567,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why not only Redis?",
   "originalText": "Why not only Redis?",
   "fontSize": 23,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "text_01257",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 868.0,
   "y": 19906.5,
   "width": 682.28,
   "height": 75.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp_diagram_13",
    "grp_column"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1894101425,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 559097505,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Because it is a window (R1-R11).\nCorrectness cannot depend on a store that can forget the very key\nwhose duplicate is arriving.",
   "originalText": "Because it is a window (R1-R11).\nCorrectness cannot depend on a store that can forget the very key whose duplicate is arriving.",
   "fontSize": 20,
