   "text": "\"definitely not seen\" -> skip the expensive lookup\n(the common new case).\n\"possibly seen\" -> CONFIRM in the real store\n(Postgres).",
   "originalText": "\"definitely not seen\" -> skip the expensive lookup (the common new case).\n\"possibly seen\" -> CONFIRM in the real store (Postgres).",
