   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example: 3,000 events/s, TTL 24 h, 120-byte entry\n\nlive keys = 3,000 x 86,400 = 259,200,000\nmemory ~= 259.2M x ~(120 + 80) bytes ~= 52 GB",
   "originalText": "Example: 3,000 events/s, TTL 24 h, 120-byte entry\n\nlive keys = 3,000 x 86,400 = 259,200,000\nmemory ~= 259.2M x ~(120 + 80) bytes ~= 52 GB",
