   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Practice: 1,500 events/s, TTL 12 h, 150-byte entries -> 1,500 x 43,200 = 64.8M keys x ~(150 + 80) bytes ~= 15 GB. Too large? Use the options\nabove.",
   "originalText": "Practice: 1,500 events/s, TTL 12 h, 150-byte entries -> 1,500 x 43,200 = 64.8M keys x ~(150 + 80) bytes ~= 15 GB. Too large? Use the options above.",
