   "updated": 1795600000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The index should fit mostly in memory to keep inserts fast; otherwise\ninsert latency rises.\nRandom uuid keys touch random pages. Time-ordered ids shrink the\nworking set to the recent pages.",
   "originalText": "The index should fit mostly in memory to keep inserts fast; otherwise insert latency rises.\nRandom uuid keys touch random pages. Time-ordered ids shrink the working set to the recent pages.",
